    <title>EP001 我的布拉格：两次邂逅的世界文化遗产城市｜欧洲最便宜的跳伞｜被遗忘的宗教改革发源地</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/667028dcb6a8412729650053</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">667028dcb6a8412729650053</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 12:15:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Present will always be the history of future.——我的两次布拉格之旅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在卡夫卡写变形记的咖啡馆吃Brunch</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmxEQRsPsvsuYq8dRWl37pkGpy_2.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>查理大桥雕塑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn_DZx6oxZGI5Ukp0j0UxsNKaARj.jfif"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjenbBvuN4fGQSuJEsuEqTm-JGtB.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>金色布拉格！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnQq_aknakLWDA6P6Bl0o8rz59Sf.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>很喜欢的艺人（大约是父子）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lirRBYmRfFbgcxj2QMbHIcVSmUm7.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>跳伞之看别人飞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liVrPxN0_Wk5fkYT5tAIxKWvxfjQ.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>跳伞之自己自由落体</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpfHuKQu8LL2Lqbsr7PbhRiS865D.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>牛肉Gulash</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj3cZcH4i_x0N3X5eK6kbCyhxnPO.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>没有许愿池的布拉格老城广场（胡斯雕像）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsuD_iVl8pmb7sf0O8Spvp_Xr2BL.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>盐不要钱的三文鱼Brunch</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lmWraSFfQusZnnKp9fo-r_19l5Sf.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>桥上的中年街头艺人组合~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpXHcveE8QOZpl8Av79PAng17Pmf.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>非常非常甜腻的烟囱筒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpSuwPu-MY8b2Z_VwQVBMeQ91sgV.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>跳舞的房子！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lihQxTSVR5A4q_IX69rtqqywj2ow.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>布拉格图书馆的书塔内部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqZVBdBYRwdQvkoh9XpYGuG10H-f.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>站前广场的舞者~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpNAlmDbF6uapjtWtvPiu3Qn09sI.jfif"></figure><span></span><p><span>查理大学附近的最美粉紫色夕阳！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo85Q1q5WyVMyqbXFFZnuktM_rMp.JPEG"></figure><span></span><p><span>绝对的末世片取景地有没有</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtS4OXc7lvpzLjV1a3sW5n2zbzj3.JPEG"></figure><span></span><p><span>圣维特主教教堂内部</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5vd1IFGi-lYSmNx_oUHy7_Ak5h.JPEG"></figure><span></span><p><span>城堡地牢的小角落</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhoOv5KevA_gE8wV9Lm0QnzZrde2.JPEG"></figure>]]></description>
